OL,3,GNEWSAStray and feral cat numbers
OL,4,A'becoming unmanageable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCat rescue charities have called for
OL,7,Fpeople to get their pets neutered both
OL,8,Fto prevent unwanted litters and improve
OL,9,Ftheir kittens' health.
OL,11,FOne Greater Manchester charity said it
OL,12,Fwas seeing a rise in stray and feral
OL,13,Fcat colonies.
OL,15,FMeanwhile Cats Protection said the
OL,16,Fnumbers of cats being neutered across
OL,17,Fthe United Kingdom had fallen in recent
OL,18,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
