OL,3,GNEWSAStray and feral cat numbers
OL,4,A'becoming unmanageable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAshlea Franks, from Independent Cat
OL,7,FRescue Prestwich (ICRP) in Greater
OL,8,FManchester, said this had led to a
OL,9,F"crisis" and warned the number of
OL,10,Fkittens was "becoming unmanageable".
